        <mxCell id="removed" value="REMOVED on 2026-11-16 (DEC-20261116-04). Mining is EFIM-only: every new request, manual or scheduled, creates exactly one EFIM run. HUI-Miner, compare mode and the benchmark endpoints (GET /api/mining/runs/{id}/benchmark and the System Admin equivalent) no longer exist, and compareAlgorithms is rejected with 400. Historical HUI-Miner runs, comparison statuses and metrics stay readable unchanged. The page keeps its number so that the numbering of the other pages does not change." style="shape=note;size=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8092A3;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=18;fontColor=#223247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
