        <mxCell id="neff" value="EXPIRED only when today &gt; expiry_date; on the expiry date the batch is still sellable. EXPIRED wins over BLOCKED. The stored status stays ACTIVE | BLOCKED and is the only writable one. daysToExpiry is 0 on the expiry date. The warning applies when the product has requires_expiry and no push day (DEC-20261124-01, -02)." style="shape=note;size=14;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8092A3;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=15;fontColor=#223247;" vertex="1" parent="1">
