        <mxCell id="r2-01-node-rbac" value="Role gap: SCREEN_OWNER_MAP assigns Merchandiser routes, but ROLE_PERMISSIONS and post-login role mapping grant F03 only, and its sidebar is disabled. BE mining submission, config, Store picker and Store snapshot/request/run reads are System Admin only (System Admin never reads raw patterns); Merchandiser/Store Admin read own-Store results and patterns and use F06." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#28253D;fontSize=14;fillColor=#fff4cc;strokeColor=#9a6700;strokeWidth=1.3;spacing=6;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
