        <mxCell id="r2-05b-note" value="SKIPPED never owns an actor, snapshot, request or run. A reserved occurrence of a schedule that is disabled or edited before preparation ends FAILED / HTTP_409; once the request exists (DISPATCHED) disabling the schedule does not stop it (D8). FAILED carries failureCode and failureMessage (V18). Schedule and configuration versions are frozen at reservation. Execution identity (D9): the machine principal SYSTEM_SCHEDULER, not the last editor. Everything on this panel is GATED: off by default (D10)." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontColor=#28253D;shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#FFF4CC;strokeColor=#9A6700;spacing=10;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
